Mohuicxitia in poyoxnacatl ica tlahcoxonacatl ihuan yei axoxtlantli ; moteci metlapan ahnozo ica tepuztlatzoaloni mochi in tlanahnamictli ; ipan zoquicaxitl motlalia in pitzochiyahuizotl ihuan motzoyonia in ayohhuachtli ; inin motlalilia mochi in omotez , in ye tlacuachhuilli ; zan tequi molinia inic ahmo motelolohchihuaz ; motlehuatza ixquichcauh ye tepitzin huacqui , motlalilia in iztayutl ; motlalilia iztatl intla monequi .
